<title>CHINA: Chuang's China Inv back to profit in yr.</title>
<headline>Chuang's China Inv back to profit in yr.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.9 gain     vs 3.8 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.38 gain    vs 9.11 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    15.23 profit vs 45.30 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     60.64	  vs 125.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chuang's China Investments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Chuang's China Investments makes electronic products and watches, develops property and is an investment group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$6.69 million on forfeiture of sale deposits and loss of HK$3.31 million from reversal of attributable profit from property development.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
